{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同移點了"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "春秋六十七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "甲午"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "庚子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "悟習刃"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "平聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "呼歷反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "伏音"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "東南院本記云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音征，為始皇名征，時人為諱正，呼以為征"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此倒釋句，知之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其音讀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄湜意，參，交參也。玄道交文殊大聖也。侔並未詳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "呼量反。《蒼頡》云：彼帛之聲\n也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蔚者慰音"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一󰊉體　二徵出　三搜玄　四難差　五責異　六詰漸　七譏動\n　八窮原　九考得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一開宗　二位體　三超境　四妙存　五辨差　六會異　七明漸　八動寂\n　九通古　十玄得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此甚當耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦合云：涅槃果有其不無之所以，故不可\n說之為無。舉有既然，無亦如此，故云無亦然耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "湜謂，涅槃懷含蘊抱，無所不包義也。無生性空統之，萬法一義也。此義已無有遷遷然、湛湛然也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄湜謂曰：既云除第四禪，復云無想為一，此豈非彼四禪天乎？幸詳之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "阻立反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "《爾雅注疏》 （摛藻堂四庫全書薈要本第3卷第18b頁）"}
